  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1730865526_2296149_75d0943f306be7e18e4db22d2028d3d0.png",
  "description": "<div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Brand introduction:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:190\">Avy Coffee is more than just a beverage; it's a journey of flavor and inspiration. We are passionate about crafting exceptional coffee experiences that fuel your day and elevate your senses.</p>\r\n<p data-sourcepos=\"5:1-5:19\"><strong>Our Commitment:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-sourcepos=\"7:1-10:0\">\r\n<li data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:123\"><strong>Premium Beans:</strong> We source the finest coffee beans from around the world, ensuring a rich and flavorful cup every time.</li>\r\n<li data-sourcepos=\"8:1-8:139\"><strong>Expert Roasting:</strong> Our skilled roasters carefully craft each batch to perfection, bringing out the unique characteristics of each bean.</li>\r\n<li data-sourcepos=\"9:1-10:0\"><strong>Ethical Sourcing:</strong> We prioritize ethical and sustainable sourcing practices to support farmers and protect the environment.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-sourcepos=\"11:1-11:39\"><strong>Discover the Avy Coffee Difference:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-sourcepos=\"13:1-16:0\">\r\n<li data-sourcepos=\"13:1-13:117\"><strong>A Symphony of Flavors:</strong> Experience a harmonious blend of tastes, from nutty and chocolatey to fruity and floral.</li>\r\n<li data-sourcepos=\"14:1-14:93\"><strong>Freshly Roasted:</strong> Our coffee is roasted to order, ensuring maximum freshness and flavor.</li>\r\n<li data-sourcepos=\"15:1-16:0\"><strong>Customizable Blends:</strong> We offer a variety of blends to suit your preferences, from bold and robust to smooth and mellow.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-sourcepos=\"17:1-17:34\"><strong>Join the Avy Coffee Community:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-sourcepos=\"19:1-21:0\">\r\n<li data-sourcepos=\"19:1-19:92\">Connect with us on social media for exclusive offers, brewing tips, and inspiring content.</li>\r\n<li data-sourcepos=\"20:1-21:0\">Become a member of our loyalty program and enjoy special perks and rewards.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-sourcepos=\"22:1-22:37\"><strong>Elevate Your Day with Avy Coffee.</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Product description:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Experience expertly roasted, ethically sourced coffee beans. Discover a world of flavor, from bold blends to single-origin delights. Experience the Avy Coffee difference today.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>USP (Unique Selling Points):&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Family-Owned</li>\r\n<li>Small Business</li>\r\n<li>Gourmet Coffee</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Payment terms:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">30% commission from each sale after the clients use your link.</p>\r\n</div>",
